# THE GAME IS NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY. For now, entirely.
#
# It is far too big to track, and the first export of it arrived on 2026-10-28.
# This replaces the five per-directory rules that only excluded Unreal's BUILD
# OUTPUT — those left game/Content/ and game/Source/ committable, which is the
# part that is actually large.
#
# The game is versioned in PERFORCE, not here (TODO items 62 and 67). This
# repository holds the PORTAL.
#
# TO PUSH SOMETHING FROM IT LATER — a plugin, a utility — un-ignore that path:
#
#     !game/Plugins/OurTool/
#
# and remember `git add -f` is not needed once the negation is in place, but a
# file already tracked stays tracked until `git rm --cached`.
game/

# Business notes are local. Planning documents for the studio, not part of
# the portal, and not published.
/business/

